       abilities (Ability_SpeechDontMove / BlastAway / Crush) so a moving target
       cannot dodge a spoken command. -->

  <!-- ========================= Straw Doll Technique ====================== -->

  <!-- A single cursed nail: little damage, but embeds a nail (Projectile_Nail).
       Nail Volley fires three of these per cast. -->
